{"name": "ZERO PARADES: For Dead Spies", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"277\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/9d1271fd2f4feae22754a0cfdc1cf200.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1099\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/b25d708637f508119236df78101d9b0d.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"161\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/b25d708637f508119236df78101d9b0d.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brilliant, burnt-out, possibly cursed \u2013 you play as operant Hershel Wilk, alias CASCADE. Five years ago you led your team into the abyss and have been haunted by your failures ever since. Now you've been recalled for a mysterious assignment that may give you a chance to prove yourself again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.poster.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.webm?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/635b8fdd48aa0489f11b517024d9da71.mp4?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/e399eea9425133718e8e098527b2c9ea.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/e399eea9425133718e8e098527b2c9ea.webp?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets hidden in the lost corners of the city and within your own mind. Navigate a murky world of potential informants and adversaries. Pass skill checks to uncover their true motivations through subterfuge, violence, or deduction. As an operant, there are multiple ways to approach every problem - your choices and methods will be your own, and so will the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.poster.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.webm?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/a9e26454c722bd843602c65e74f0368a.mp4?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/6dbe5230300840fa28d463b75f652615.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6dbe5230300840fa28d463b75f652615.webp?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find yourself thrown into a three-way struggle for cultural and ideological power, played out across an unforgettable city. You'll go up against international bankers, foreign techno-fascists, psychic doppelg\u00e4ngers, a paranoid TV presenter, a man with a box for a heart, and dozens more. Everyone you meet has their own agendas, beliefs, and secrets for you to uncover and turn to your own ends. In ZERO PARADES, even the world itself is a character with its own secrets, traumas, and miracles for you to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.poster.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.webm?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/c8e0cdc26493e1c033ae100d1a659e52.mp4?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/6d17ef6a824e9091c0feddf42b408948.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6d17ef6a824e9091c0feddf42b408948.webp?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operants subject themselves to years of psychological training to hone their minds into their greatest weapons. Do you favor animal-like reflexes, a philosophical approach, or a different cover story for every occasion? Through Conditioning, you'll turn the deepest aspects of Hershel's identity into potent abilities and unlock new paths forward. You can even change the rules of the game itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/fb9affc69d41bcb1e40d17e8e5b32589.poster.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/fb9affc69d41bcb1e40d17e8e5b32589.webm?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/fb9affc69d41bcb1e40d17e8e5b32589.mp4?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/1d6bd67306c3314085d7d5366cc2907c.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/1d6bd67306c3314085d7d5366cc2907c.webp?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressures simulate the physical and psychological toll of being in-theatre. Exertion pushes dice rolls in your favour \u2013 just remember that you\u2019re gambling with your life. Keep your Fatigue, Anxiety, and Delirium in check or deal with the long-term repercussions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6b8848035a246875bbc404a505f35a17.poster.avif?t=1786953986\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6b8848035a246875bbc404a505f35a17.webm?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6b8848035a246875bbc404a505f35a17.mp4?t=1786953986\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras_big/6544042a9a181b6cf044afdfb26a6558.webp?t=1786953986\" height=\"58\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/extras/6544042a9a181b6cf044afdfb26a6558.webp?t=1786953986\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this line of work you're going to fail way more often than you succeed. That much is expected of you. What matters is how you pick yourself back up. If the dice don't go your way (and they won't) you'll have to improvise and hope the consequences are ones you can live with.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "From the creators of Disco Elysium comes ZERO PARADES \u2013 an espionage RPG. You're a brilliant but tormented operant on one final desperate assignment. Gather your broken network, untangle a web of lies, and prove yourself on the world stage - or blow it all up again.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863680/9bb6aa338885131045ddb7e124e67b359ea61d90/header.jpg?t=1786953986", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Indie", "Story Rich", "Thriller", "Female Protagonist", "Choices Matter"], "developers": "ZA/UM", "publishers": "ZA/UM", "release_date": "May 21, 2026", "price": "$39.99", "appid": "2863680", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/_i9t4gNqOMo", "first_seen": 1771801200.0, "review_rank": 1122}